.TH pvc-run 1  "pvc-run " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-run \- Run a preset, with optional \-\-set overrides
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-run\fR [\fB\-\-set\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPRESET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a preset, with optional \-\-set overrides
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-set\fR \fI<KEY=VALUE>\fR
Override a field before running, e.g. `\-\-set stretch=1.5`. Unqualified keys apply under `[params]`; `section.key` targets another table; `tool`/`input`/`output` are top\-level fields
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPRESET\fR>
Path to a preset TOML file
